<% content_for :title, "Benchmarks" %>
<h1>Benchmarks</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Short GPU benchmarks and video decode throughput from omarchy-m-test's Benchmarks section, compared per Mac model and Omarchy stack/version. Each machine counts once per row, with its latest score; a row shows the median of its machines.</p>

<% if @scores.empty? %>
  <%= card "scores" do %>
    <p class="dim">No report has a benchmark score yet. Run <code>omarchy-m-test</code> and keep the Benchmarks section to add one.</p>
  <% end %>
<% else %>
  <% @scores.benchmarks.each do |benchmark| %>
    <%= render "benchmarks/benchmark", benchmark: %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
<p class="dim">The macOS column is what macOS measured on the same Mac, under the conditions it names: a description, not a verdict. Storage compares only at the same SSD capacity.</p>
<p class="dim">Scores are only compared within one benchmark: the same scenes or clip and settings (suite). Anything else the Mac was doing lowers a score. <a href="<%= api_v1_benchmarks_path(format: :json) %>">benchmarks.json</a> (CC0).</p>
